# Design Specifications - ICTServe Frontend Mockup

## Document Information
- **Version:** 1.0.0
- **Date:** 2025-11-28
- **Status:** Draft
- **References:** D12, D13, D14

## 1. Color Palette (WCAG 2.2 AA Compliant)

### Primary Colors
```css
/* MOTAC Blue */
--primary-50: #eff6ff
--primary-600: #0056b3  /* 6.8:1 contrast on white ✅ */
--primary-700: #004494  /* Hover state */

/* Secondary Blue */
--secondary-600: #0B4D8F
--secondary-700: #084173
```

### Status Colors
```css
/* Success */
--success-600: #198754  /* 4.9:1 contrast ✅ */

/* Warning */
--warning-600: #ff8c00  /* 4.5:1 contrast ✅ */

/* Danger */
--danger-600: #b50c0c   /* 8.2:1 contrast ✅ */
```

### Neutral Colors
```css
--slate-50: #f8fafc
--slate-100: #f1f5f9
--slate-500: #64748b
--slate-900: #0f172a
```

## 2. Typography

### Font Family
- **Primary:** Open Sans, Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif
- **Fallback:** -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI"

### Font Sizes
```css
/* Base */
--text-sm: 14px    /* Small text */
--text-base: 16px  /* Body text (minimum WCAG) */
--text-lg: 18px    /* Large text */
--text-xl: 20px    /* Headings */
--text-4xl: 36px   /* Hero heading (desktop) */
--text-5xl: 48px   /* Hero heading (large screens) */
```

### Line Heights
```css
--leading-tight: 1.25   /* Headings */
--leading-normal: 1.5   /* Body (WCAG compliance) */
--leading-relaxed: 1.75 /* Descriptions */
```

## 3. Layout Structure

### Container
```html
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <!-- Content -->
</div>
```

### Grid System
- **Mobile (< 768px):** 1 column (cards stack)
- **Tablet (≥ 768px):** 2 columns
- **Desktop (≥ 1024px):** 3 columns

```html
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
  <!-- Cards -->
</div>
```

## 4. Component Specifications

### 4.1. Header

**Structure:**
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ [Logo + MOTAC BPM] │ [Nav Links] │ [Lang] [Auth]    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Specifications:**
- Height: `h-20` (80px)
- Background: `bg-primary-600` (#0056b3)
- Text color: `text-white`
- Logo size: 32-40px
- Sticky: `sticky top-0 z-10`

**Navigation Links:**
- Font size: `text-sm font-medium`
- Hover state: `hover:text-blue-200`
- Active state: `text-white font-bold`
- Spacing: `space-x-8`

### 4.2. Hero Section

**Specifications:**
- Background: `bg-white`
- Padding: `py-20` (80px vertical)
- Border: `border-b border-gray-100`

**Heading:**
- Font size: `text-4xl md:text-5xl`
- Font weight: `font-bold`
- Color: `text-gray-900`
- Alignment: `text-center`

**Subheading:**
- Font size: `text-xl`
- Color: `text-gray-600`
- Max width: `max-w-2xl mx-auto`

### 4.3. Service Cards

**Card Container:**
```css
.card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 12px;        /* rounded-xl */
  border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;  /* border-gray-100 */
  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); /* shadow-sm */
  transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}

.card:hover {
  box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); /* shadow-md */
}
```

**Card Structure:**
```
┌─────────────────────┐
│                     │
│   [Icon Circle]     │ ← 64×64px, bg-blue-50
│                     │
│   [Card Title]      │ ← text-xl font-bold
│   [Description]     │ ← text-sm text-gray-500
│                     │
├─────────────────────┤ ← border-t border-gray-100
│   [Action Button]   │ ← Full width, primary blue
└─────────────────────┘
```

**Icon Specifications:**
- Size: `h-16 w-16` (64×64px)
- Background: `bg-blue-50`
- Icon color: `text-primary-600`
- Border radius: `rounded-full`
- SVG size: `h-8 w-8`

**Button Specifications:**
- Width: `w-full`
- Padding: `py-3 px-4`
- Background: `bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700`
- Text: `text-white font-semibold`
- Border radius: `rounded-lg`
- Focus ring: `focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-primary-600`

### 4.4. Footer

**Structure:**
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ © 2025 BPM MOTAC  │  [Social Icons]        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Specifications:**
- Background: `bg-gray-800`
- Text color: `text-gray-300`
- Padding: `py-8`
- Flex layout: `flex justify-between items-center`

**Social Icons:**
- Size: `h-6 w-6`
- Color: `text-gray-400 hover:text-white`
- Spacing: `space-x-6`
- Transition: `transition-colors`

## 5. Interactive States

### Focus States
```css
button:focus, a:focus, input:focus {
  outline: 3px solid #0056b3;  /* primary-600 */
  outline-offset: 2px;
}
```

### Hover States
```css
.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

button:hover {
  background-color: #004494; /* primary-700 */
}
```

### Active States
```css
button:active {
  transform: scale(0.98);
}
```

## 6. Accessibility Annotations

### ARIA Landmarks
```html
<header role="banner">
  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
    <!-- Navigation -->
  </nav>
</header>

<main role="main" id="main-content">
  <!-- Main content -->
</main>

<footer role="contentinfo">
  <!-- Footer -->
</footer>
```

### Focus Indicators
- All interactive elements: `focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-primary-600`
- Minimum contrast: 3:1
- Offset: 2-4px

### Touch Targets
- Minimum size: 44×44px
- Applied classes: `min-h-[44px]` or `h-11 w-11`
- Touch spacing: 8px gap between targets

## 7. Responsive Breakpoints

### Tailwind Breakpoints
```javascript
{
  'sm': '640px',   // Mobile landscape
  'md': '768px',   // Tablet
  'lg': '1024px',  // Desktop
  'xl': '1280px',  // Large desktop
  '2xl': '1536px'  // Extra large
}
```

### Responsive Utilities
```html
<!-- Mobile first -->
<div class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl">
  Responsive text
</div>

<!-- Grid -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-6 lg:gap-8">
  <!-- Cards -->
</div>
```

## 8. Animation & Transitions

### Durations
```css
--duration-fast: 150ms
--duration-normal: 300ms
--duration-slow: 500ms
```

### Easing
```css
--ease-in-out: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)
--ease-out: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1)
```

### Motion Preferences
```css
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * {
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}
```

## 9. Design Tokens (Tailwind Config)

### Recommended Tailwind Config Extension
```javascript
module.exports = {
  theme: {
    extend: {
      colors: {
        primary: {
          50: '#eff6ff',
          600: '#0056b3',
          700: '#004494',
        },
      },
      minHeight: {
        44: '44px',
      },
      minWidth: {
        44: '44px',
      },
    },
  },
}
```

## 10. Component Checklist

- [ ] Header with MOTAC branding
- [ ] Sticky navigation
- [ ] Language switcher (BM | EN)
- [ ] Hero section with heading + subheading
- [ ] 3 service cards (Aduan ICT, Pinjaman Aset, Semak Status)
- [ ] Card icons (SVG, properly sized)
- [ ] Primary action buttons
- [ ] Footer with copyright + social links
- [ ] Responsive layout (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- [ ] Focus states visible
- [ ] Touch targets ≥44px
- [ ] ARIA landmarks
- [ ] Screen reader compatible
